# Words this crate's names keep although helpers/abbreviations.py in the shared workflows does not
# know them: one lowercase word per line, then why it stays (the source that spells it so, or why
# nobody says its expansion). A line without a reason is refused. Plurals with `s` or `es` follow.
#
# lba  the specifications and every reader say LBA
cmos  the PC clock chip and every reader of it say CMOS; the expansion names a process, not the device
pl  part of PL031, Arm's PrimeCell part number, which its reference manual and device trees spell so
unix  the Unix epoch is the name the POSIX and C standards and every reader use
